WHAT THIS COVERS

This licence covers the Skills AI application — the Android app published under
the package name `gfly.skillsai.app`, its source code, its user interface, its
artwork and its accompanying service at ai.ehsanking.ir.

It does NOT cover the third-party skills and prompts the app redistributes.
Those remain under the licences their own authors chose, and every one of them
is named in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. Nothing in this file takes anything away
from them.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

You may download, install and use the application, including the release builds
published on this repository, for personal or commercial purposes, on any number
of your own devices, for as long as you like. No account is required to use the
catalogue and no payment is required to install a build published here.

You may quote, screenshot and write about the application freely.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

You may not redistribute, resell, sublicense or publish the application or any
modified version of it. You may not decompile, reverse engineer or extract the
application's own content, artwork or code for use in another product. You may
not publish the application, or anything derived from it, to any application
store or download site.

WHY IT IS WRITTEN THIS WAY

The application is free. Free is not the same as open source, and this file says
which one it is rather than letting the price imply the other. You pay nothing to
download it, install it or use it, and no account is needed to read the
catalogue; what is not offered is permission to take the code, rename it and
publish it as something else.

Calling it open source when the source is not open would be worse than either
choice, so it is not called that.

The catalogue is a different matter. The skills in it were written by other
people and offered under CC0, MIT, Apache-2.0 and CC-BY-4.0, and the conditions
those licences attach are honoured: every source is named, every notice travels
with the work, and the full licence texts ship inside the application as well as
sitting in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md beside this file. A skill whose author gave no
licence at all was not included, because no licence means no permission.

